'''Emily Jenness''' is an American voice actress for the English-language dub of {{aniseries|PTS}} and {{aniseries|HZ}}. She was born '''Emily Ann Bauer''' and is also credited as '''Emily Blau'''. She is currently affiliated with CESD Talent Agency.

==Biography==
Jenness was born as Emily Ann Bauer on July 29, 1981, in New Jersey. After graduating from New York University in 2002 with degrees in Business and Theatre, she became a voice actress and voiced several characters in her career. Jenness joined {{aniseries|PTS}} in [[S10|the tenth season]]. Her most notable role is that of {{Ash}}'s friend {{an|Dawn}}. She has also provided voices for various characters since.

